---
description: Domain packs extend AetherOS without changing core contracts.
alwaysApply: false
---

- Domain-specific facts, standards, ontology, KPI thresholds, and source policies belong in domain packs.
- A new domain must not require Cursor rule changes or AetherOS core schema changes.
- Domain claims must carry provenance, scope, and confidence.
- If domain context is insufficient, return `BLOCKED_CONTEXT` instead of guessing.
